01B3   6F                     LD   L,A   
01B4   26 07                  LD   H,LETPAGE   
01B6   F7                     RST   30h   
01B7                             ; A-Z: call the word. The return address (the IP after the letter) goes on
01B7                             ; the return stack, and the IP becomes the address in the letter's cell.
01B7   C5           UPPER:    PUSH   BC   ; the return address, for rpushn
01B8   EB                     EX   DE,HL   ; park TOS
01B9   87                     ADD   A,A   
