02A1                             ; "$" prints the string at TOS, decoding escapes: "/" plus a character from
02A1                             ; 60h to 7Eh is one of the escapes at pesc; "/" plus any other character
02A1                             ; clears that character"s bit 6 (/M is CR, /? is DEL"s "?"; "/" and """ have
02A1                             ; no bit 6, so // and /" give themselves).
